stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE: ticket consumed, live written consent and election for the modality
    ACTIVE --> ACTIVE: sync to a further device, server-synced mode only
    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: erasure request opens, any trigger
    SUSPENDED --> ERASING: due time reached, phase 1 key destroyed or not applicable
    ERASING --> CLOSED: every device item confirmed or closed by attestation
    CLOSED --> ERASING: an item reopens, returning device or restored backup
    CLOSED --> [*]
    note right of SUSPENDED
        Server copy unreadable except to the erasure job.
        A device still holding the template can match it,
        and every such match raises M4.
    end note
    note right of CLOSED
        Row tombstoned, key gone.
        Re-enrolment creates a new template id.
        No state leads back to ACTIVE.
    end note
